		"frozenBy": { "sessionName": "SCARLET_BRIDGE", "date": "2026-08-16", "note": "lines frozen at checkpoint 1 under SABLE_RIVER's freeze ruling; the debug block 1ce6cbd9… reproduced by runs 2 and 3; materialiseReal awaited the supervisor's spend authorisation, which was withheld until the GO of 2026-08-16 19:21 CDT and recorded from 2e6a3ac — BR3-8. That GO now lives under spendAuthorisationByLine.materialiseReal; the flat materialiseRealSpendAuthorisedBy field it was first written to is RETIRED (RULING B4R-2, 2026-08-17), so this sentence is history and not a description of the file" }
